          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "detail": 0,
                "format": 0,
                "mode": "normal",
                "style": "",
                "text": "I speak about the future of the interface today and how AI and spatial computing/XR actually operates in the real world.",
                "type": "text",
                "version": 1
              }
            ],
            "direction": null,
            "format": "",
            "indent": 0,
            "type": "paragraph",
            "version": 1,
            "textFormat": 0,
            "textStyle": ""
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "detail": 0,
                "format": 0,
                "mode": "normal",
                "style": "",
                "text": "From spatial computing to agent systems — I focus on what happens after the model, when AI has to act inside products and environments.",
                "type": "text",
                "version": 1
              }
            ],
            "direction": null,
            "format": "start",
            "indent": 0,
            "type": "paragraph",
            "version": 1,
            "textFormat": 0,
            "textStyle": ""
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "detail": 0,
                "format": 0,
                "mode": "normal",
                "style": "",
                "text": "As the first O’Reilly author in AI + spatial computing in over five years, my work focuses on how these systems are actually built and used — not just where they might go.",
                "type": "text",
                "version": 1
              }
            ],
            "direction": null,
            "format": "start",
            "indent": 0,
            "type": "paragraph",
            "version": 1,
            "textFormat": 0,
            "textStyle": ""
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "detail": 0,
                "format": 0,
                "mode": "normal",
                "style": "",
                "text": "I’ve been building in AI and spatial computing since 2015 as an engineer, founder, and former CTO.",
                "type": "text",
                "version": 1
              }
            ],
            "direction": null,
            "format": "start",
            "indent": 0,
            "type": "paragraph",
            "version": 1,
            "textFormat": 0,
            "textStyle": ""
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "detail": 0,
                "format": 0,
                "mode": "normal",
                "style": "",
                "text": "Logistical notes: ",
                "type": "text",
                "version": 1
              }
            ],
            "direction": null,
            "format": "start",
            "indent": 0,
            "type": "heading",
            "version": 1,
            "tag": "h2"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "detail": 0,
                "format": 1,
                "mode": "normal",
                "style": "",
                "text": "Before you submit:",
                "type": "text",
                "version": 1
              },
              {
                "detail": 0,
                "format": 0,
                "mode": "normal",
                "style": "",
                "text": " Erin fields a high volume of inbound requests. To move efficiently, please complete the form in full. Incomplete submissions will not receive a response.",
                "type": "text",
                "version": 1
              }
            ],
            "direction": null,
            "format": "",
            "indent": 0,
            "type": "paragraph",
            "version": 1,
            "textFormat": 1,
            "textStyle": ""
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "detail": 0,
                "format": 0,
                "mode": "normal",
                "style": "",
                "text": "Upon review, qualifying engagements will receive a prep call link. Logistics and fee discussion happens there.",
                "type": "text",
                "version": 1
              }
            ],
            "direction": null,
            "format": "",
            "indent": 0,
