                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "detail": 0,
                      "format": 0,
                      "mode": "normal",
                      "style": "",
                      "text": "Most talks on AI and spatial computing stay at a surface level  and on trends— without the technical depth, historical context, or understanding of real system constraints.",
                      "type": "text",
                      "version": 1
                    }
                  ],
                  "direction": null,
                  "format": "",
                  "indent": 0,
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "version": 1,
                  "textFormat": 0,
                  "textStyle": ""
                },
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "detail": 0,
                      "format": 0,
                      "mode": "normal",
                      "style": "",
                      "text": "Mine focus on what actually works — how these systems get built, shipped, and made to work in practice. ",
                      "type": "text",
                      "version": 1
                    }
                  ],
                  "direction": null,
                  "format": "",
                  "indent": 0,
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "version": 1,
                  "textFormat": 0,
                  "textStyle": ""
                },
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "detail": 0,
                      "format": 0,
                      "mode": "normal",
                      "style": "",
                      "text": "I break down how AI moves from models into real-world execution — inside products, workflows, and userenvironments.",
                      "type": "text",
                      "version": 1
                    }
                  ],
                  "direction": null,
                  "format": "start",
                  "indent": 0,
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "version": 1,
                  "textFormat": 0,
                  "textStyle": ""
                },
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "detail": 0,
                      "format": 0,
                      "mode": "normal",
                      "style": "",
                      "text": "I’m the lead author of ",
                      "type": "text",
                      "version": 1
                    },
                    {
                      "detail": 0,
                      "format": 2,
                      "mode": "normal",
                      "style": "",
                      "text": "Creating Augmented and Virtual Realities",
                      "type": "text",
                      "version": 1
                    },
                    {
                      "detail": 0,
                      "format": 0,
                      "mode": "normal",
                      "style": "",
                      "text": " (O’Reilly), published after a multi-year gap in technical books on VR — and my work continues to sit at the intersection of emerging technology and real-world application.",
                      "type": "text",
                      "version": 1
                    }
                  ],
                  "direction": null,
                  "format": "",
                  "indent": 0,
